329 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 240 0 R
/E (This project focuses on the data analysis of customer reviews from the Amazon Movies & TV category, with the objective of extracting meaningful insights from large-scale textual data. The main challenge lies in processing and analyzing a massive volume of unstructured reviews to evaluate customer satisfaction and support decision-making.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
330 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 240 0 R
/E (To address this problem, a Big Data approach was adopted, combining data engineering, natural language processing \(NLP\), and machine learning techniques. The dataset was cleaned and transformed, and text data was converted into numerical representations using TF-IDF. Classification models were then applied to perform sentiment analysis and categorize reviews as positive, negative, or neutral.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
331 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 240 0 R
/E (The results highlight key trends in customer behavior, including sentiment distribution, review patterns over time, and product performance. An interactive dashboard was developed using Power BI to visualize these insights effectively.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
332 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 240 0 R
/E (This project demonstrates how data-driven approaches can enhance understanding of customer feedback and support strategic business decisions.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
