/Title (Sentiment Over Time The sentiment over time analysis shows that positive reviews consistently dominate across all periods, with a significant increase in volume in later years. Negative and neutral sentiments remain relatively low in comparison. This indicates that the growth in review volume is largely driven by positive customer experiences, reinforcing the overall satisfaction trend observed in the dataset. This page provides insights into temporal trends and customer engagement patterns.)
